    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >VENGEANCE AND INTROSPECTION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by games such as &quot;Half-Life&quot;, &quot;Doom&quot; or even works such as &quot;Neon Genesis Evangelion&quot; , in this Boomer Shooter you take the role of an escaped super soldier as she embarks on a journey of self discovery and revenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A DAMNED WORLD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up in a strange looking version of our world, one that is full of destruction and ruin, remnants of past wars and apocalyptic events, is covered in oceans of blood, is being oversaw by a totalitarian extremist organization, and has a number of humanoid abominations roaming it's wastelands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >YOUR BRAIN IS YOUR ENEMY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your brain is extremely confused and deranged because of the 20 years of constant information being pumped into it, it sometimes misleads you and presents you with nightmarish visions of your actions and deepest desires.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >VENGEANCE AND INTROSPECTION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by games such as &quot;Half-Life&quot;, &quot;Doom&quot; or even works such as &quot;Neon Genesis Evangelion&quot; , in this Boomer Shooter you take the role of an escaped super soldier as she embarks on a journey of self discovery and revenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A DAMNED WORLD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up in a strange looking version of our world, one that is full of destruction and ruin, remnants of past wars and apocalyptic events, is covered in oceans of blood, is being oversaw by a totalitarian extremist organization, and has a number of humanoid abominations roaming it's wastelands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >YOUR BRAIN IS YOUR ENEMY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your brain is extremely confused and deranged because of the 20 years of constant information being pumped into it, it sometimes misleads you and presents you with nightmarish visions of your actions and deepest desires.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
